// Durable detached task control surface (`doc/reference/dispatch.md` §3).
//
// `TaskRef` is the opaque handle produced by the `dispatch` expression.
// `status` queries the durable task state and `cancel` performs
// before-start cancellation; both return compiler-known discriminated union
// values whose `kind` spellings match the reference verbatim.

native function status(ref: TaskRef) -> TaskStatus
native function cancel(ref: TaskRef) -> TaskCancelResult
